    "title": "Who made it to Indy for Final Four? March Madness schedule, where to watch, tickets, NCAA bracket",
    "text": "March 29, 2026, 7:29 p.m. ETThe 2026 Final Four is set for Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis. The NCAA men's basketball tournament March Madness games on Saturday, April 4, and Monday, April 6, will be shown on TBS.Here's what you need to know about the weekend, the 2026 March Madness bracket, odds, picks and predictions:What channel is Arizona basketball vs Michigan game on TV Saturday, April 4? How to watch Arizona vs Michigan basketball March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Final Four game liveThe Arizona vs Michigan game will air on TBS approximately 30 minutes after Illinois-UConn on Saturday, April 4, 2026.Watch NCAA Tournament action SlingWhat channel is Illinois basketball vs Connecticut game on TV Saturday, April 4? How to watch Illinois vs UConn basketball March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Final Four game liveThe Illinois vs UConn game will play on TBS at 6:09 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingStream the Arizona basketball vs Michigan game on TV Saturday, April 4? How to watch Arizona vs Michigan basketball March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Final Four game liveThe Arizona vs Michigan game will stream via SlingTV at approximately 8:39 pm. ET, Saturday, April 4, 2026. Fans can download SlingTV in the Apple App Store or on Google Play.Watch NCAA tournament action with a free Fubo trialStream the Illinois basketball vs Connecticut game on TV Saturday, April 4? How to watch Illinois vs UConn basketball March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament Final Four game liveThe Illinois vs UConn game will stream via SlingTV at 6:09 pm. ET, Saturday, April 4, 2026. Fans can download SlingTV in the Apple App Store or on Google Play.Watch NCAA tournament action with a free Fubo trial2025-2026 Arizona Wildcats regular season record, Big 12 conference recordArizona Wildcats: (36-2, 16-2 Big 12)2025-2026 Michigan Wolverines regular season record, Big Ten conference recordMichigan Wolverines: (35-3, 19-1 Big Ten)2025-2026 Illinois Fighting Illini regular season record, Big Ten conference recordIllinois Fighting Illini: (28-8, 15-5 Big Ten)2025-2026 Connecticut Huskies regular season record, Big East conference recordUConn Huskies: (33-5, 17-3 Big East)How much are Final Four tickets? How much do Final Four tickets cost at Lucas Oil Stadium on Saturday, April 4?Check Final Four ticket availability on StubHubMarch Madness 2026 NCAA tournament bracket schedule of games tonight: Start time, TV channel, where to watch, stream every men's basketball game2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight March Madness results Sunday, March 29(1) Michigan Wolverines 95, (6) Tennessee Volunteers 62 | Box score(2) UConn Huskies 73, (1) Duke Blue Devils 72 | Box score2026 NCAA tournament Elite Eight March Madness results Saturday, March 28(3) Illinois Fighting Illini 71, (9) Iowa Hawkeyes 59 | Box score(1) Arizona Wildcats 79, (2) Purdue Boilermakers 64 | Box scoreWatch the NCAA Tournament on Sling2026 NCAA tournament Final Four round March Madness games at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 6 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, TBS.March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament championship game at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 8:30 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, TBS.Watch the Final Four on Sling2026 NCAA tournament odds for March Madness bracket betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.2026 March Madness bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
